    {
      "id": "parts",
      "size": "1024x1024",
      "prompt": "Image 1 is a sticker of a classic inflatable beach ball. Draw it as a cut-out paper puppet: its separate pieces laid out on one sheet, the same drawing style, colours, texture, line and proportions as in image 1, every piece at the size it has in image 1 (if they do not all fit, draw them all a little smaller, at the same scale as each other).\n\nDraw each piece on its own, spread out over the sheet with wide empty gaps between them, no piece touching or overlapping another:\n1. the beach ball exactly as in image 1: its red, yellow, blue and white segments, its white valve on top and its shine.\n\nEvery piece is drawn whole, including what is normally hidden behind another piece, with its edges clean and smooth. It is an object, not a character: no face, no eyes, no mouth. No text, no labels, no numbers, no outline around the pieces beyond the drawing's own line, no shadows, no water, no sand, no splashes or drops. Fully transparent background."
    }
  ],
